{title: Khilte Hain Gul Yahaan}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Sharmili S D Burman}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Khilate hain [F]gul yahaan,
[F]khil ke [Dm]bikharane ko
[Dm]Milate hain [F]dil yahaan,
[Dm]mil [F]ke [Dm]bichhadane ko
[Dm]Khilate hain gul yahaan...
[Dm]Kal rahe naa rahe,
[F]mausam ye [Dm]pyaar ka
[Dm]Kal ruke [F]na ruke,
[Am]dola [Dm]bahaar ka
[F]Chaar pal mile jo aaj,
[G]pyaar men [Dm]guzaar de
[Dm]Jhilon ke honthon par,
[F]meghon ka [Dm]raag hai
[Dm]Phoolon ke seene men,
[Am]thandi-thandi [Dm]aag hai
[F]Dil ke aaine men tu,
[G]ye sama [Dm]utaar de
[Dm]Pyaasa hai dil sanam,
[F]pyaasi ye [Dm]raat hai
[Dm]Honthon me dabi-dabi,
[Am]koi mithi [F]baat hai
[F]In lamhon pe aaj tu,
[G]har khushi [Dm]nisaar de
